stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Attached
    Attached --> Detached: socket close, holdSeat = !draining
    note right of Detached
        closeSession.lua:
        SREM sessions, SREM conn:{ip}
        HSET detachedAt, EXPIRE = RESUME_GRACE_SECONDS (20s)
        instanceId is DELIBERATELY LEFT IN PLACE
        (an empty one reads as PARTNER_GONE → ends the conversation)
        user_match is DELIBERATELY LEFT IN PLACE
        (endMatch clears both sides; clearing ours strands the partner)
    end note
    Detached --> Attached: resume token redeemed<br/>→ restoreMatch + announceReturn<br/>→ partner_returned
    Detached --> Reaped: 20s lapses → row expires<br/>→ janitorMatches ends the match,<br/>returns the survivor to notify
    Attached --> Torn: draining → holdSeat=false<br/>→ endMatch → partner_disconnected
    Reaped --> [*]
    Torn --> [*]
